            "name": "Jan & Gary Boulter"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Update July 2024 - another very successful meeting with Alan. Helped me focus on where I am going with a project and provided quality food for thought on both the technical and composition elements of my photography. Enjoyed as always  Great webinar on editing, really useful advice to achieve your objective for an image. Small group and interactive, with Alan showing you step by step, the various Editing options.  Really enjoyed it",
