            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Customer"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I’ve been on a few of Alan’s courses as well as 1-2-1 mentoring and weekend away. His knowledge is first class and expertly given and I can see a massive difference. Not just in my images but also in my approach to taking an image, how to critique it and then to process it using a standard workflow. Would recommend Alan who want so improve regardless of what level you are at",
