          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Tim Davenport"
          },
          "reviewBody": "A very flexible worthwhile course. Very inspiring style encouraging you to take more photos.   Alongside these courses Alan offers a wide range of services to help improve your photograghy skill set - Workshops in beautiful locations plus 1-2-1 mentoring.  I will certainly be attending more of Alan's worthwhile courses and workshops.",
